# NOTE: diverges from dsh-agent-processes on purpose.
#   - `lib/` IS tracked (siblings track it; `prepare` falls back to prebuilt lib/).
#   - `agent/` IS tracked, unlike the sibling, so the overnight agent's acceptance
#     scripts survive into the morning review. Drop it from git before a public
#     publish if you'd rather not ship them.

